msgstr "Dapatkan kunci API gratis"

#: includes/class-plugin.php:169
msgid "Open Settings"
msgstr "Buka Pengaturan"

#: includes/class-plugin.php:241
msgid "Enjoying AstroWay?"
msgstr "AstroWay"

#: includes/class-plugin.php:242
msgid ""
"A short review on wordpress.org helps other site owners discover the plugin,"
" and tells us what to build next."
msgstr ""
"Ulasan singkat di wordpress.org membantu pemilik situs lain menemukan plugin"
" ini, sekaligus memberi masukan kepada kami tentang fitur apa yang sebaiknya"
" kami kembangkan selanjutnya."

#: includes/class-plugin.php:246
msgid "Leave a review"
msgstr "Berikan ulasan"

#: includes/class-plugin.php:309
msgid "This server has used up its anonymous AstroWay quota:"
msgstr "Server ini telah menghabiskan kuota AstroWay anonimnya:"

#: includes/class-plugin.php:310
msgid ""
"the free tier allows this site 300 requests an hour. Until the hour resets, "
"widgets that would have been rendered into the page fall back to a frame "
"loaded by the visitor's own browser, and preview and admin calls from this "
"server will fail. Add a free API key to lift the limit and get 10,000 "
"credits/month plus 60 req/min."
msgstr ""
"Paket gratis ini membatasi situs ini hingga 300 permintaan per jam. Sampai "
"hitungan jam tersebut direset, widget yang seharusnya ditampilkan di halaman"
" akan dialihkan ke bingkai yang dimuat oleh browser pengunjung sendiri, dan "
"panggilan pratinjau serta admin dari server ini akan gagal. Tambahkan kunci "
"API gratis untuk menghapus batasan tersebut dan dapatkan 10.000 kredit per "
"bulan serta 60 permintaan per menit."

